<title>FRANCE: Elf Atochem in Shanghai chemical plant.</title>
<headline>Elf Atochem in Shanghai chemical plant.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf Atochem, the chemicals unit of Elf Aquitaine, said it had signed a letter of intent with Shanghai Pacific Chemical to set up a joint venture for the construction of a hydrazine hydrate plant in Shanghai.</p>
<p>The new 10,00 tonnes per year plant will operate an Elf Atochem system using hydrogen peroxide and start-up is scheduled for the second half of 1998.</p>
<p>Elf Atochem gave no financial details.</p>
</text>
